---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy — PaperMatrix AI">
  <Header />
  <main class="flex-1 max-w-3xl mx-auto w-full px-4 sm:px-6 py-16 text-zinc-300">
    <div class="border-b border-zinc-800 pb-6 mb-8">
      <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-100 tracking-tight">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-500 mt-1">Effective Date: September 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-8 text-xs leading-relaxed">
      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-100 uppercase tracking-wider font-mono">1. Zero Persistent Document Storage</h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-400">
          PaperMatrix AI prioritizes academic privacy and intellectual confidentiality. Uploaded PDF files are held entirely in ephemeral RAM buffers during extraction and analysis. Once parsing completes, buffers are instantly garbage collected. No document payloads or full texts are stored on disks or centralized databases.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-100 uppercase tracking-wider font-mono">2. Anonymous Quota Tracking</h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-400">
          To enforce the 3 daily free synthesis credits, we generate a one-way hardware hash via client-side fingerprinting. This hash is purely anonymous, non-reversible, and decoupled from any personal identifying information (PII) such as email, IP address, or names.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-100 uppercase tracking-wider font-mono">3. Third-Party Inference</h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-400">
          Extracted structural chunks are transmitted securely over HTTPS to Groq inference hardware for low-latency synthesis. Zero user queries are used to train foundational AI models.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>